  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9d52e811169e234b996c7a3d9272a3f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue: {fileID: 91567674}
  TextToBeShown:
  - Tunku with Tun H.S.Lee, Tun V.T. Sambanthan, Tun Razak, Sultan of Kedah that
    time, and Tun Dr.Ismail form a delegation for independence.
  - The purpose of this delegation is to negotiate full self-government for Malaya,
    also to set a date
  - The negotiation took weeks to come to an end.
  - British Prime Minister Anthony Eden agreed to grant independence.
  - The Merdeka Agreement  was signed on February 8, 1956.
  - At the same time, Malaysia Independence Day was announced.
  - Which is on August 31, 1957.
  viewDistance: 7
